The width is 4, while the height is 2.
The left is width, while the right is height.
Repeat while right is more than 0.
The carry is left modulo right.
Set left to right.
Set right to carry.

The short is width divided by left, while the tall is height divided by left.
The corner is 1.
If short modulo 2 is 0, set corner to 2.
If short modulo 2 is 1 and tall modulo 2 is 0, set corner to 0.

Show corner.
